      "message": "The logic here is not obvious at the first glance. I think this looks more clear:\n\nint status \u003d stream_output(fds[0], STDOUT_FILENO);\nif (status !\u003d 0) return status;\nreturn listener-\u003egetExitCode();\n\nwhere getExitCode() simply returns the exit code saved in the listener",
